msgstr "Connessione automatica"

#: extension/prefs.js:230
msgid ""
"Connect when you put your AirPods in or start playing, unless another device "
"is using them"
msgstr ""
"Connetti quando indossi gli AirPods o avvii la riproduzione, a meno che un "
"altro dispositivo li stia usando"

#: extension/prefs.js:235
msgid "Switch With Your Apple Devices"
msgstr "Passa tra i tuoi dispositivi Apple"

#: extension/prefs.js:236
msgid ""
"The AirPods move between this computer and your iPhone, iPad or Mac on their "
"own, as between Apple devices. This computer then presents itself as an "
"Apple device to Apple accessories. Takes effect the next time the AirPods "
"connect."
msgstr ""
"Gli AirPods passano da soli da questo computer al tuo iPhone, iPad o Mac, "
"come tra dispositivi Apple. Questo computer si presenta quindi come un "
"dispositivo Apple agli accessori Apple. Ha effetto alla prossima connessione "
"degli AirPods."

